/* DATA DESCRIPTION:
Citation:	Helm, Veit; Franke, Steven; Steinhage, Daniel; Eisen, Olaf; Zuhr, Alexandra; Bodart, Julien A; Sutter, Johannes (2026): ANT 2023/24: AWI airborne ultra-wideband radar data between Sør Rondane Mountains and the eastern DML ice divide (CHARISO Project) [dataset]. PANGAEA, https://doi.org/10.1594/PANGAEA.990049
Abstract:	In the Antarctic austral summer season of 2023/24 AWI ultra-wideband (UWB) data was acquired across prominent ice-streams draining parts of the DML region as part of the CHARISO (Swiss (CH) Antarctic Research Initiative - ISOchrones in East Antarctic outflow regions) project, providing an opportunity to trace isochrones there and compare their pattern with modelled isochrones from ice-sheet modelling. The data were further used to extend the layering across existing AWI DML lines in the upper section near the ice divide, and over the main ice divide to link up specific isochrones with the EDML and Dome Fuji ice cores and were recorded in a frequency range between 180-210 MHz. The data are available for both data products (qlook: unfocused; standard: SAR focused) as netCDF files (including waveforms and metadata), KML files of the profile line locations, and quicklook images of the radargrams.
Keyword(s):	AWI UWB; Dronning Maud Land; East Antarctica; ice divide; Ice Sheet; Internal Reflection Horizon; Polar 6; radio-echo sounding; Sør Rondane Mountains
Related to:	Eisen, Olaf; Steinhage, Daniel; Franke, Steven; Helm, Veit; Binder, Tobias; Drews, Reinhard; Eagles, Graeme; Humbert, Angelika; Jansen, Daniela; Jokat, Wilfried; Lambrecht, Astrid; Mieth, Matthias; Riedel, Sven; Miller, Heinrich (2024): Collection of datasets from AWI's radio-echo sounding systems on ice sheets and glaciers [dataset bibliography]. PANGAEA, https://doi.org/10.1594/PANGAEA.972094
	Franke, Steven; Steinhage, Daniel; Helm, Veit; Binder, Tobias; Nixdorf, Uwe; Miller, Heinrich; Humbert, Angelika; Jansen, Daniela; Eagles, Graeme; Eisermann, Hannes; Jokat, Wilfried; Ruppel, Antonia; Drews, Reinhard; Zuhr, Alexandra; Driemel, Amelie; Walter, Andreas; Konopatzky, Peter; Heß, Robin; Haas, Antonie; Koppe, Roland; Andreas, Pascal H; Eisen, Olaf (2026): Review article: 30 years of airborne radar surveys on the Antarctic and Greenland ice sheets by the Alfred Wegener Institute. The Cryosphere, 20(4), 2485-2530, https://doi.org/10.5194/tc-20-2485-2026
Additional metadata:	O2A Registry: Metadata for radar system Ultra-wideband ice radar at current Version. Alfred Wegener Institut Helmholtz Centre for Polar and Marine Research, https://registry.o2a-data.de/items/6809
Further details:	Bodart, Julien A; Sutter, Johannes (2025): Dated radar Internal Reflection Horizons (IRHs) from Dronning Maud Land (East Antarctica) for ice-sheet model calibration (Version V1) [dataset]. Zenodo, https://doi.org/10.5281/ZENODO.17348976
